DESCRIPTION:Dynamic wines\, smooth spirits\, and downright delicious beers
 .\n\nSince launching in 1998\, the Rocky Mountain Wine & Food Festival\, p
 resented by Sobeys Liquor & Safeway Liquor\, has been Alberta’s largest 
 and most beloved food & adult beverage event\, welcoming hundreds of exhib
 itors and thousands of guests travelling from across Western Canada each y
 ear!\n\nThe Rocky Mountain Wine & Food Festival is an opportunity to taste
  and try a selection of adult beverages and local cuisine\, while learning
  about the processes and people behind your favourite sips and bites! Disc
 over and explore a variety of fine wines\, premium spirits\, and craft bee
 rs\, and meet chefs from local restaurants who will be serving up deliciou
 s fare to pair with the wonderful assortment of drinks!\n\nFriday\, Nov. 6
  Evening Session: 5:30p.m.-10:000p.m.\n\nSaturday\, Nov. 7 Afternoon Sessi
 on: 12:00p.m.-4:00p.m.\n\nSaturday\, Nov. 7 Evening Session: 6:00p.m.-10:0
 0p.m.\n\nPro tip: Get 40% off General Admission tickets with the code EXPL
 ORE\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nSchedule: Friday\, November 6\, 2026 at 12:00 PM
 –4:00 PM\nLocation: Edmonton Convention Centre - 9797 Jasper Avenue\, Ed
 monton\, Alberta\, CA\nTickets / Visit site: https://rockymountainwine.com
 /edmonton-wine-food-festival/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.c
 om/event-calendar/rocky-mountain-wine-food-festival
