BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Love Pro Wrestling x Art Gallery of Alberta: The Joy of Grappling
DTSTART;TZID=America/Edmonton:20261107T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Edmonton:20261107T170000
DTSTAMP:20261107T125909Z
UID:e32525228ca57ceadf4d7d50612ddc83@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/AGA.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Love Pro Wrestling and the AGA invite you to an unforgettable 
 afternoon of art\, performance and sport. Featuring portraits of wrestlers
  by artist Kim Parrent and compelling images of Stampede Wrestling by phot
 ographer George Webber\, this unique event pairs exhibition experiences wi
 th live wrestling action in the heart of the gallery!\n\nSurround the squa
 red circle\, cheer on your favourite stars and soak up the fun as drama\, 
 athleticism and larger-than-life personalities collide. Expect big moves\,
  bold stories and plenty of surprises as wrestlers battle it out in a seri
 es of epic matches.\n\nGallery admission is included in the price of your 
 ticket. The exhibitions are open 11am to 5pm so come early or stay after t
 he match to see Kim Parrent: Ring A Ding Dong Dandy and Sports! The Art of
  Competing.\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nSchedule: Saturday\, November 7\, 2026 a
 t 11:00 AM–5:00 PM\nLocation: Art Gallery of Alberta - 2 Sir Winston Chu
 rchill Sq\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nTickets / Visit site: https://www.you
 raga.ca/whats-on/aga-x-love-pro-wrestling\nExplore Edmonton: https://explo
 reedmonton.com/event-calendar/love-pro-wrestling-x-art-gallery-of-alberta-
 the-joy-of-grappling
LAST-MODIFIED:20261107T125751Z
LOCATION:Art Gallery of Alberta - 2 Sir Winston Churchill Sq\, Edmonton\, 
 Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/love-pro-wrestling-x-art-ga
 llery-of-alberta-the-joy-of-grappling
