 de Wrestling by photographer George Webber\, this unique event pairs exhib
 ition experiences with live wrestling action in the heart of the gallery!<
 /p><p>Surround the squared circle\, cheer on your favourite stars and soak
  up the fun as drama\, athleticism and larger-than-life personalities coll
 ide. Expect big moves\, bold stories and plenty of surprises as wrestlers 
