BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:5th Annual Broad View International Film Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Edmonton:20261114T190000
DTSTAMP:20261107T125909Z
UID:37e04d00c7edd9ec56e82a5211f85ce3@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Exterior-Garneau-Theatre-
 2025.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Calling all movie lovers\, this is the festival for you!\n\nTh
 e Broad View International Film Festival is dedicated to showcasing the wo
 rk of women directors from Edmonton's own backyard\, across Canada and aro
 und the world!\n\nThe 5th annual festival opens Nov. 12 at 7:00 PM with th
 e exquisite documentary AGATHA'S ALMANAC by Amalie Atkins\, followed by a 
 festive reception. The full festival program includes shorts\, feature len
 gth films\, dramas and documentaries\, and Q&A's with guest directors. Bro
 ad View closes on Saturday with the feature film\, JIMPA - a tender study 
 of intergenerational family dynamics starring Olivia Coleman.\n\nEVENT INF
 ORMATION\nSchedule: Saturday\, November 14\, 2026 at 7:00 PM\nLocation: Me
 tro Cinema\, 8712 109 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nTickets / Visit site: 
 https://broadviewfilmfest.com/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmonton.
 com/event-calendar/5th-annual-broad-view-international-film-festival
LAST-MODIFIED:20261107T125628Z
LOCATION:Metro Cinema\, 8712 109 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/5th-annual-broad-view-inter
 national-film-festival
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Calling all movie lovers\, this is the fes
 tival for you!</p><p>The Broad View International Film Festival is dedicat
 ed to showcasing the work of women directors from Edmonton&#x27\;s own bac
 kyard\, across Canada and around the world!</p><p>The 5th annual festival 
 opens Nov. 12 at 7:00 PM with the exquisite documentary AGATHA&#x27\;S ALM
 ANAC by Amalie Atkins\, followed by a festive reception. The full festival
  program includes shorts\, feature length films\, dramas and documentaries
 \, and Q&amp\;A&#x27\;s with guest directors. Broad View closes on Saturda
 y with the feature film\, JIMPA - a tender study of intergenerational fami
 ly dynamics starring Olivia Coleman.</p><h3>Event Information</h3><ul><li>
 <strong>Schedule:</strong> Saturday\, November 14\, 2026 at 7:00 PM</li><l
 i><strong>Location:</strong> Metro Cinema\, 8712 109 St\, Edmonton\, Alber
